{"title":"2006 USA TST","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The 2006 USA Team Selection Test (TST) was used together with the 2006 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"USAMO\">USAMO</a> to determine the United States <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"International Mathematical Olympiad\">International Mathematical Olympiad</a> (IMO) team. \n</p><p>The first link contains the full set of test problems. The rest contain each individual problem and its solution. \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_USA_TST_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 USA TST Problems (page does not exist)\">2006 USA TST Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_USA_TST_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">2006 USA TST Problems/Problem 6</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018052830\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2650:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018052830 and revision id 6403. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}